{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "dismiss(state, kind), unmute(state, kind) -> the new state; muted(state, kind) -> boolean. A state is a count from 0 to 2 for each of the five kinds; two mute a kind. Clicking Not now, OK or × counts, folding the island unseen does not (that is the app's call). mute(state, kind) mutes a kind at once (a switch turned off in Settings), the same as two dismissals.",
